          "c": "公公同婆婆好錫我。",
          "j": "gung4 gung1 tung4 po4 po2 hou2 sek3 ngo5.",
          "e": "Grandpa and Grandma love me dearly.",
          "note": "<strong>錫</strong> (sek3) is the warm family word for \"love\" — what grandparents do to grandchildren. It also means \"to kiss\".",
